{
  "hash": 1888882410,
  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "Collecting an Elemental Pickup enables Weapon Damage to generate Melee Ability energy per hit for 8 seconds. \n\n<arc/>Ionic Traces, <stasis/>Stasis Shards, and Shot <strand/>Tangles extend the timer by 4 seconds. <solar/>Firesprites, <void/>Void Breaches, and Thrown <strand/>Tangles extend the timer by 8 seconds. \n\nTimer can be extended to a maximum of 16 seconds.\n\nMelee energy granted by weapon type:\nSpreadshot HC: <enhanced/>${0.5 * #d}%\nBurst Sidearm: <enhanced/>${0.78 * #d}%\nFusion Rifle: <enhanced/>${1.15 * #d}%\nRocket Pulse: <enhanced/>${1.95 * #d}%\nSidearm: <enhanced/>${2.34 * #d}%\nScout: <enhanced/>${3.34 * #d}%\nRocket Launcher: <enhanced/>${12.9 * #d}%\n\nElemental Pickups include <solar/>Firesprites, <arc/>Ionic Traces, <stasis/>Stasis Shards, <strand/>Tangles, and <void/>Void Breaches.\n\nenhanced (\nvar d = 1.1\n<enhanced/> Melee Energy generated is increased by 10%.\n)",
      "updatedAt": "2026-02-22T21:37:25.694Z",
      "updatedBy": "Hawkmoona"
    }
  },
  "associated": [],
  "compendium": {
    "gid": "1662574278",
    "rowKey": "Collective Pugilism",
    "section": "Weapon Traits",
    "snapshot": {
      "plain": "On Elemental-Pickup Interaction:\nEach scored damage instance grants ↑increased Melee Ability Energy for an Elemental-Pickup based duration.\nAverages 10% ↑11% Melee Energy per second under Sustained Damage.\nMelee Gain Formula: 10% / (1 / (60 / RPM)\nChecks out for non-burst Weapons. Rocket Launchers assume 2 procs per shot. Swords assume 60RPM.\n\nFiresprites and Void Breaches grant +8 seconds. \nIonic Traces, Stasis Shards, and both the Pickup AND Explosion of Tangles/Arc Elemental Orbs grant +4 seconds. \nAdditional pickups extend the buff duration by their corresponding duration, up to 16 seconds.\nBuff can be activated while stowed, and persists through stow.\n\nApproximate Melee Ability Gains per Damage Instance scored:\nRapid-Fire Shotgun: ↑0.35% | Adaptive SMG: ↑0.66% + Adaptive Trace: ↑0.67%\nRapid-Fire Auto: ↑0.825% | Lightweight Pulse: ↑0.88% | Precision SMG + Aggressive MG: ↑0.99%\nAggressive Fusion: ↑1.05% | Rapid-Fire Fusion: ↑1.12% | Rapid-Fire Sidearm + High-Impact Pulse: ↑1.31%\nHigh-Impact MG: ↑1.65% | Adaptive Fusion: ↑1.76% | Heavy-Burst Pulse: ↑2.3% \nPrecision Scout: ↑3.33% | Precision HC: ↑3.4% | High-Impact Scout: ↑3.97%\nAdaptive HC: ↑4.26% | Aggressive HC: ↑4.95% | Breech GL + Adaptive Sniper: ↑6.6%\nRapid-Fire Glaive: ↑7.04% | Swords: ↑9.9% | Aggressive Rocket: ↑10.77%\nAdaptive Rocket: ↑11.65% | Precision LFR: ↑12.38%",
